{"id":"5e1000a4d0dd2b92","group":"58","path":"58/batch07/58-prop-chain-density.md","title":"Nonemptiness of Dense Sets","display":"prop-chain-density — Nonemptiness of Dense Sets","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-prop-chain-density","aliases":["58-prop-chain-density"],"display":"prop-chain-density — Nonemptiness of Dense Sets","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-prop-chain-density"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-prop-chain-density</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-chain-density — Nonemptiness of Dense Sets"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D,P,\\leq_P,p,q\\in V\">\\(D,P,\\leq_P,p,q\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Poset}\">\\(\\mathrm{Poset}\\)</span> (poset predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DenseIn}_S(D,P,\\leq_P)\">\\(\\mathrm{DenseIn}_S(D,P,\\leq_P)\\)</span> (typed dense-subset predicate defined below)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}dense\\text{-}in\\text{-}poset} \\vdash \\mathrm{DenseIn}_S(D,P,\\leq_P)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)\\land D\\subseteq P\\land\\forall p\\in P\\;\\exists q\\in D\\;(\\langle q,p\\rangle\\in\\leq_P)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}dense\\text{-}in\\text{-}poset} \\vdash \\mathrm{DenseIn}_S(D,P,\\leq_P)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)\\land D\\subseteq P\\land\\forall p\\in P\\;\\exists q\\in D\\;(\\langle q,p\\rangle\\in\\leq_P)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}chain\\text{-}density} \\vdash \\mathrm{DenseIn}_S(D,P,\\leq_P)\\land P\\neq\\varnothing\\to D\\neq\\varnothing\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}chain\\text{-}density} \\vdash \\mathrm{DenseIn}_S(D,P,\\leq_P)\\land P\\neq\\varnothing\\to D\\neq\\varnothing\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Choose any <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in P\">\\(p\\in P\\)</span>; density supplies <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\\in D\">\\(q\\in D\\)</span> with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\\leq_P p\">\\(q\\leq_P p\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>A dense subset need not literally intersect every antichain; generic filters are instead required to meet every dense set belonging to the ground model.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-df-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Poset}$ (poset predicate, see [[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"D,P,\\leq_P,p,q\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Poset}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DenseIn}_S(D,P,\\leq_P)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}dense\\text{-}in\\text{-}poset} \\vdash \\mathrm{DenseIn}_S(D,P,\\leq_P)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)\\land D\\subseteq P\\land\\forall p\\in P\\;\\exists q\\in D\\;(\\langle q,p\\rangle\\in\\leq_P)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}chain\\text{-}density} \\vdash \\mathrm{DenseIn}_S(D,P,\\leq_P)\\land P\\neq\\varnothing\\to D\\neq\\varnothing","display":true},{"tex":"p\\in P","display":false},{"tex":"q\\in D","display":false},{"tex":"q\\leq_P p","display":false}],"bytes":1097,"backlinks":[{"id":"746b177ad471e105","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{DenseIn}_S$ (typed dense-subset predicate, see [[58-prop-chain-density]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3941","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-prop-chain-density.md|58-prop-chain-density]]（batch07）"}],"outgoing":["d3f859dbdd37f018"]}